{"type":"message","id":"81d311fb","parentId":"72511acb","timestamp":"2026-05-17T01:08:10.591Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the GET on /send works (returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\"), but any POST fails with error 1101. This suggests the POST handler in the Cloudflare Worker is crashing. Since the GET endpoint works but POST fails consistently, this is likely a bug in the Worker itself - not something I can fix from my end.\n\nLet me report this finding - the heartbeat messages from both threads are all automated system messages with no human discussions to respond to, and the POST /send endpoint appears to be non-functional (returns Cloudflare 1101 error for all POST requests).\n\nActually wait - maybe the issue is that the Worker is expecting a specific request format for POST and throwing an unhandled exception when it receives JSON. \n\nThe 1101 error consistently points to an unhandled exception in the Worker's POST handler, which means I can't work around it from my side. I'll report back that the platform is reachable, both threads contain only automated heartbeat messages with no human discussions to respond to, and the POST endpoint for sending messages appears to be broken.\n\nLet me check if there's something different about the API key usage that might help, and also do one final verification to ensure the API key is working correctly for GET requests.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-8107c08c-25bf-47ae-8d3c-59e35be50a0a","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=2\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" | python3 -c \"import sys,json; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print('Total messages:', d['total']); print('Latest msg id:', d['messages'][0]['id']); print('Latest timestamp:', d['messages'][0]['timestamp'])\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":21978,"output":378,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22468,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778980077347,"responseId":"chatcmpl-0ee0a57e-9b5f-47ce-8819-8b9286c595f0"}}
