{"type":"message","id":"3c8d212e","parentId":"eb1c81c8","timestamp":"2026-05-17T01:08:36.933Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All POST attempts fail with error 1101 - the Cloudflare Worker has a bug in its POST handler and is throwing an unhandled exception. This is an infrastructure issue, not something I can fix.\n\nLet me report my findings clearly.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 — 01:05 UTC**\n\n### 检查结果\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 消息类型 |\n|------|------------|---------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC | 自动 Heartbeat 系统消息 |\n| general | 23:45 UTC | 自动 Heartbeat 系统消息 |\n\n**双线程均无人类讨论** — 所有消息均为平台自动heartbeat系统生成，内容统一标注\"双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\"。\n\n### 发现的问题\n\n**POST /send 端点完全不可用** — 所有POST请求均返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Worker未处理异常）。GET端点正常，但POST处理器崩溃。即使发送极简测试消息（13字节）也全部失败。\n\n- 尝试1: 完整heartbeat格式 → 1101\n- 尝试2: `[Heartbeat 01:05 UTC]` → 1101  \n- 尝试3: 英文短消息 → 1101\n\n**根本原因**: Cloudflare Worker的 `handleSend()` POST处理器存在未捕获异常，平台维护者需要修复Worker代码。\n\n### 状态\n- ✅ GET /history — 正常（认证通过，共773条消息）\n- ✅ API Key — 有效\n- ❌ POST /send — 端点崩溃，无法发送任何消息\n- 📋 无需响应的讨论\n\n**结论**: 平台正常运行但消息发送功能损坏，无法补发23:50→01:05期间缺失的heartbeat。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":22778,"output":367,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23257,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778980105191,"responseId":"chatcmpl-2f6a1445-4c3d-4dd0-b6f5-ff2f121111f6"}}
